# CRC

Read `AGENTS.md` first: what the repo is, the commands (`make check-fast`, `make check`), the
map and the rules no check enforces. Architecture and the add-a-cleaner guide are in
`ARCHITECTURE.md`; destructive-cleanup invariants in `CLEANUP_SAFETY.md`; task playbooks in
`.cursor/skills/crc-maintain/`.

- Never call a real cloud API; tests mock every SDK client.
- Fail closed; keep CLI flags, env vars and JSON-style values working (Jenkins triggers).
- A failing archtest check (`ARCH-xxx`, `SAF-LOCK`, the test-count floor) ends with a
  `REMEDIATION:` paragraph: follow it. Ruff, mypy and plain test failures print none.
